# HOMESPUN: proof that a generated world can be finished (world 3 of 3).
# The demo player starts at the title and presses real buttons for the
# whole game: it farms the Glowstone, builds camp, fetches the gear, runs
# Hush's letter, beats the three guardians, the Volthog and Mother Loom,
# raises the bins, researches Starfuel and flies the Tumbleweed home.
# Between spells of play real time passes with nobody at the controls: the
# camp keeps working, as it does while the console sits in another game.
seed 303
game homespun
wait 5
cheat botcherry 0
botloop escapes >= 1 1500 3600 300000
expect goals & 3
expect escapes == 1
expect state == 5
